{"lyrics":"[Intro: Anuel AA]\n[00:05.66]Uah\n[00:11.30]Hey, Rvssian\n[Pre-Coro: Anuel AA]\n[00:12.54]Yo siempre te llamo tarde en la noche (En la noche)\n[00:15.74]Casi siempre despué' de las 12 (De las 12)\n[00:18.18]Si el sexo e' una religión, pues somo' diose'\n[00:21.18]Pero no somo' ni JAY-Z ni Beyoncé (Uah)\n[00:22.78][Coro: Anuel AA &\n[00:23.30]Juice WRLD\n[00:24.06]]\n[00:24.38]No me ame', no me, no me ame' (Eh-eh)\n[00:26.50]No me llame', bebé, no me reclame' (Eh-eh)\n[00:31.36]No me llame', baby, yo te llamo (Uah)\n[00:33.16]Que si no' vamo' en sentimiento', nos peleamo' (Nos peleamo')\n[00:36.36]Don't you love me, don't you love me? (Uah)\n[00:39.54]Don't call me, and, baby, don't claim me (Eh-eh)\n[00:42.32]I call you, then we fight, and then we make up (Eh-eh)\n[00:45.18]We catch a body in the bed, but don't catch feelings\n[Verso 1: Anuel AA]\n[00:47.70]Tú no entiende' que te odio (Yeh)\n[00:49.16]Que me hiciste un demonio (Yeh)\n[00:50.64]Que yo te di el anillo y tú jodiste el matrimonio (Uah)\n[00:53.78]Y el amor no es ciego (Ciego)\n[00:55.10]Ciego e' el que persigue al que no lo quiere (Al que no lo quiere')\n[00:57.92]¿Por qué tú me sugiere' que yo me quede contigo? (Contigo)\n[01:01.28]¿Si cómo te vo'a amar, si yo no me amo ni a mí mismo? (Uah)\n[01:04.14]Yo lo que quiero' e' erotismo\n[01:05.96]Y hago que tú te moje' (Tú te moje')\n[01:08.20]Y no e' en el bautismo (Yeah-yeah)\n[01:09.62]Yo te hago, ma, a ti te hago un exorcismo, yeah (Uah)\n[01:12.38][Coro: Anuel AA &\n[01:13.00]Juice WRLD\n[01:13.52]]\n[01:13.86]No me ame', no me, no me ame' (Eh-eh)\n[01:15.36]No me llame', bebé, no me reclame' (Eh-eh)\n[01:18.34]No me llame', baby, yo te llamo (Uah)\n[01:21.28]Que si no' vamo' en sentimiento', nos peleamo' (Nos peleamo')\n[01:24.36]Don't you love me, don't you love me? (Eh-eh)\n[01:27.54]Don't call me, and, baby, don't claim me (No, no)\n[01:30.32]I call you, then we fight, and then we make up (Yo te llamo, baby)\n[01:33.30]We catch a body in the bed, but don't catch feelings (Uah)\n[Verso 2: Juice WRLD]\n[01:36.06]Don't get too attached, I'm bad news\n[01:37.76]I'll break your heart, leave it permanent like gettin' a tattoo\n[01:40.76]I'll do you worse than your ex-boyfriend did you\n[01:43.90]Next thing you know, you'll be seeing shadows in your room, room\n[01:48.30]I know you seen me on TV and on the internet\n[01:51.10]Tryna get over me, but the hurting isn't finished yet\n[01:54.12]Ooh, I'ma still make love to you\n[01:58.20]I'ma still take drugs for you\n[Pre-Coro: Anuel AA]\n[02:00.00]Yo siempre te llamo tarde en la noche (En la noche)\n[02:03.74]Casi siempre despué' de las 12 (De las 12)\n[02:06.20]Si el sexo e' una religión, pues somo' diose'\n[02:09.12]Pero no somo' ni JAY-Z ni Beyoncé (Uah)\n[02:10.76][Coro: Anuel AA &\n[02:11.30]Juice WRLD\n[02:11.88]]\n[02:12.36]No me ame', no me, no me ame' (Eh-eh)\n[02:14.50]No me llame', bebé, no me reclame' (Eh-eh)\n[02:18.34]No me llame', baby, yo te llamo (Uah)\n[02:21.16]Que si no' vamo' en sentimiento', nos peleamo' (Nos peleamo')\n[02:24.38]Don't you love me, don't you love me? (Uah)\n[02:27.38]Don't call me, and, baby, don't claim me (Eh-eh)\n[02:30.32]I call you, then we fight, and then we make up (No, no)\n[02:33.16]We catch a body in the bed, but don't catch feelings\n[Outro: Anuel AA]\n[02:36.32]Anuel\n[02:37.00]Mera, dime, Rvssian, lo' Illuminati, ¿ah?\n[02:41.34]El dio' del trap, ¿oíste, bebé?\n[02:44.66]Real hasta la muerte, bebecita\n[02:47.22]Brr","words":[[5.66,11.26,"Uah"],[11.3,11.38,"Hey,"],[11.44,11.98,"Rvssian"],[12.54,12.58,"Yo"],[12.72,13.04,"siempre"],[13.14,13.2,"te"],[13.3,13.58,"llamo"],[13.68,13.92,"tarde"],[13.98,14.0,"en"],[14.04,14.12,"la"],[14.26,14.68,"noche"],[14.74,14.76,"(En"],[15.04,15.22,"la"],[15.32,15.48,"noche)"],[15.74,15.98,"Casi"],[16.1,16.46,"siempre"],[16.5,16.92,"despué'"],[16.98,17.0,"de"],[17.08,17.18,"las"],[17.2,17.26,"12"],[17.3,17.32,"(De"],[17.36,17.66,"las"],[17.68,17.92,"12)"],[18.18,18.22,"Si"],[